[02:48.32] The captain wired in he had water comin' in
[02:51.89] And the good ship and crew was in peril
[02:56.11] And later that night when his lights went outta sight
[02:59.64] Came the wreck of the Edmund Fitzgerald
[03:22.97] Does anyone know where the love of God goes
[03:26.66] When the waves turn the minutes to hours?
[03:32.63] The searches all say they'd have made Whitefish Bay
[03:36.23] If they'd put fifteen more miles behind her
[03:42.28] They might have split up or they might have capsized
[03:45.10] They may have broke deep and took water
[03:50.21] And all that remains is the faces and the names
